      "description": "Creates a bar chart using the list of data with corresponding frequencies.",
      "usage": {
        "text": "Creates a bar chart using the list of data with corresponding frequencies.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n* `++BarChart({10, 11, 12, 13, 14}, {5, 8, 12, 0, 1})++`\n* `++BarChart({5, 6, 7, 8, 9}, {1, 0, 12, 43, 3})++`\n* `++BarChart({0.3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.6}, {12, 33, 13, 4})++`\n\n====\n\n[NOTE]\n====\n\nThe numbers in the list of raw data need to be arranged in increasing order.\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
