      "arity": {
        "min": 3,
        "max": 3,
        "variadic": false
      },
      "outputKind": "unknown",
      "outputCardinality": "unknown",
      "effect": "unknown",
      "dimension": "unknown",
      "safety": "unknown",
      "description": "Calculates P(u ≤ X ≤ v) by applying the previous syntax (with Cumulative = false) and adding the values obtained when the elements of the List of values are used as variable values.",
      "usage": {
        "text": "Calculates P(_u_ ≤ X ≤ _v_) by applying the previous syntax (with _Cumulative_ = false) and adding the values obtained when the elements of the _List of values_ are used as _variable values_.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++BinomialDist(10, 0.2, {1,2,3})++` yields stem:[\\frac{1507328}{1953125}], and is equivalent to `++BinomialDist(10, 0.2, 1, false)++` + `++BinomialDist(10, 0.2, 2, false)++` + `++BinomialDist(10, 0.2, 3, false)++`\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
      "context": {
        "overview": {
          "text": "",
          "truncated": false
        },
        "related": [],
        "omittedRelated": 0
      },
