        "text": "Returns the https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Characteristic_polynomial[characteristic polynomial] of the given matrix.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++CharacteristicPolynomial({{1,2},{3,4}})++` yields stem:[x^2-5x-2].\n\n====",
