        "text": "Finds the complex roots of a given polynomial in _x_.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++ComplexRoot(x^2 + 4)++` yields _{- 2 ί, 2 ί}_\n\n====\n\n[NOTE]\n====\n\nUse xref:/commands/CSolve.adoc[CSolve Command] instead.\n\n====",
