      "description": "Gives n-th https://bernard-gibert.pagesperso-orange.fr/ctc.htmltriangle cubic of the given triangle ABC.",
      "usage": {
        "text": "Gives _n_-th https://bernard-gibert.pagesperso-orange.fr/ctc.html[triangle cubic] of the given triangle _ABC_.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\nLet _A = (0, 1)_, _B = (2, 1)_ and _C = (1, 2)_. `++Cubic(A, B, C, 2)++` yields the implicit curve _-x³ + 3x² + 5x y² -\n14x y + 7x - 5y² + 14y = 9_.\n\n====\n\n[NOTE]\n====\n\nThis command is in development, set of supported index _n_ is changing.\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
