        "text": "Calculates the polynomial regression model of given _degree_ that fits the specified _points_.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++FitPoly({(-1, -1), (0, 1), (1, 1), (2, 5)}, 3)++` yields _x^3^ - x^2^ + 1_.\n\n====",
