        "text": "Checks if a function is written in vertex form.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++IsVertexForm((x+2/3)^2-(2/3)^2)++` yields _true_\n\n====\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++IsVertexForm(2*(3 x-2)^(2)+1)++` yields _false_\n\n====",
