        "text": "Computes the probability of a normal random variable in the interval [_u_, _v_], given the mean and the standard deviation. In other words, the syntax `Normal(_m_, _s_, _u_, _v_)` is equivalent to `Normal(_m_, _s_, _v_, true) - Normal(_m_, _s_, _u_, true)`",
