        "text": "Attempts (numerically) to find a solution for the equation for the main variable. For non-polynomials you should\n  always specify a starting value (see below).\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++NSolve(x^6 - 2x + 1 = 0)++` yields _{x = 0.51, x = 1}_.\n\n====",
