        "text": "Finds numerically the list of solutions to the given equation for the given unknown variable with its starting value.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n* `++NSolve(cos(x) = x, x = 0)++` yields _{x = 0.74}_\n* `++NSolve(a^4 + 34a^3 = 34, a = 3)++` yields _{a = 0.99}_.\n\n====",
