            "text": "= Circumference Command\n:page-en: commands/Circumference\nifdef::env-github[:imagesdir: /en/modules/ROOT/assets/images]\n\nCircumference(Conic)::\n  If the given conic is a circle or ellipse, this command returns its circumference. Otherwise the result is undefined.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++Circumference(x^2 + 2y^2 = 1)++` yields _5.4_.\n\n====\n\n[NOTE]\n====\n\nSee also xref:/commands/Perimeter.adoc[Perimeter] command.\n\n====\n",
            "truncated": false
