      "usage": {
        "text": "Creates the pole, given a polar line and a conic.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++Polar(1.5x+0.5y=4, y = x^2 - 3x + 5)++` creates the point _(0, 2)_\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
