        "text": "Generates a random number from a Poisson distribution with given mean.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++RandomPoisson(3)++` yields a random value from a Poisson distribution with a mean of _3_.\n\n====\n\n[NOTE]\n====\n\nSee also xref:/commands/SetSeed.adoc[SetSeed command], xref:/commands/RandomBetween.adoc[RandomBetween command],\nxref:/commands/RandomElement.adoc[RandomElement command], xref:/commands/RandomBinomial.adoc[RandomBinomial command],\nxref:/commands/RandomNormal.adoc[RandomNormal command], xref:/commands/RandomUniform.adoc[RandomUniform command].\n\n====",
