        "text": "Calculates the sum of squares of _y_-coordinates of the given points.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\nLet `++list = {(-3, 4), (-1, 4), (-2, 3), (1, 3), (2, 2), (1, 5)}++` be a list of points. `++SigmaYY(list)++` yields _a\n= 79_.\n\n====",
