      "usage": {
        "text": "Attempts to find the exact solution of the first order ODE stem:[\\frac{dy}{dx}(x)=f'(x, y(x))] and returns the solution\nthrough the given point (Cauchy problem).\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n`++SolveODE(y / x, (1, 2))++` yields _y = 2x_.\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
