      "effect": "unknown",
      "dimension": "unknown",
      "safety": "unknown",
      "description": "Replaces in expression all occurrences of from with to and evaluates the result when variables are substituted with values.",
      "usage": {
        "text": "Replaces in _expression_ all occurrences of _from_ with _to_ and evaluates the result when variables are substituted with values.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\n* `++Substitute((3 m - 3)^2 - (m + 3)^2, m, a)++` yields _8 a^2^ - 24 a_.\n\n* `++Substitute((3 m - 3)^2 - (m + 3)^2, m, 2)++` yields _-16_.\n\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
