      "description": "Creates the tangent to the spline in the given point.",
      "usage": {
        "text": "Creates the tangent to the spline in the given point.\n\n[EXAMPLE]\n====\n\nLet _A = (0, 1)_, _B = (4, 4)_ and _C = (0, 4)_. `++Tangent(A, Spline({A, B, C}))++` yields line _a_: _y_ = _0.59x + 1_.\n\n====",
        "truncated": false
      },
